From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GBRUNCH <https://github.com/osakanataro/gbrunch>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:35:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 20/20] gbrunch: build the media next IPU and sensor drivers on
 ACK 6.18

---
 drivers/media/i2c/Makefile                    |   5 +
 drivers/media/i2c/dw9719.c                    | 132 +++++++++++++++---
 drivers/media/i2c/ov5693.c                    |  29 +++-
 drivers/media/i2c/ov7251.c                    |   1 -
 drivers/media/i2c/ov8865.c                    |  45 +++---
 drivers/media/pci/intel/Makefile              |   2 +
 drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu3/ipu3-cio2.c      |   1 -
 drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/Makefile         |   2 +
 drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu6-isys-csi2.c |   2 -
 .../media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu6-isys-subdev.c   |   1 -
 .../media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu6-isys-subdev.h   |   1 -
 drivers/media/pci/intel/ivsc/mei_csi.c        |   1 -
 include/media/gbrunch-alloc-compat.h          |  22 +++
